   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/leyawn.bsky.social/post/3mxa6uqicl22t",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "Claude AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "Literally everything I've written for public consumption is in the training data, often in more than one language. Via the Anthropic settlement I'm getting (not nearly enough) compensation for about 20 of them, but it's doubtful I'll ever get compensation for 28 years of writing on my blog, etc.",
   "handle": "scalzi.com",
   "display_name": "John Scalzi",
   "likes": 552,
   "reposts": 64,
   "replies": 11,
   "created_at": "2026-10-05T21:27:51.742Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/scalzi.com/post/3mx5uaysomc2o",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "Anthropic"
  },
  {
   "text": "Also, when it's trivially easy to get an LLM to disgorge entire large chunks of pilfered text from its training data, the argument that other uses are \"transformative\" are, well, not the slam dunk you might think they are",
   "handle": "scalzi.com",
   "display_name": "John Scalzi",
   "likes": 592,
   "reposts": 34,
   "replies": 12,
   "created_at": "2026-10-06T13:00:45.792Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/scalzi.com/post/3mx7if5t5s22o",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "LLM"
  },
  {
   "text": "The Psychonauts agent felt queasy after taking on his most daring operation yet.\npaletteswap.site/dif...",
   "handle": "paletteswap.site",
   "display_name": "Palette Swap",
   "likes": 403,
   "reposts": 86,
   "replies": 5,
   "created_at": "2026-10-06T15:01:00.000Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/paletteswap.site/post/3mx7p47dlnh23",
   "image": "img/2026-10-07/4ed415ee294e6fab.webp",
   "external": "",
   "query": "AI agent"
  },
  {
   "text": "CM @chiosse.bsky.social calls out the AI execs on some of their statements today, made under oath: \n\n\"I know that a couple companies said that they supported the Raise Act, but let's be real here: It is well known that OpenAI, Anthropic, Google, Meta lobbied against the Raise Act for a year.\"",
   "handle": "jessyedwards.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Jessy Edwards",
   "likes": 314,
   "reposts": 86,
   "replies": 3,
   "created_at": "2026-10-05T18:59:12.563Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/jessyedwards.bsky.social/post/3mx5lx6t3qs2e",
   "image": "img/2026-10-07/8032fc48895a03cb.webp",
   "external": "",
   "query": "Anthropic"
  },
  {
   "text": "ai psychosis? not me. claude says im special. different than the rest of you. more than mortal. immune to the trappings of humanity. a god? a golden god.",
   "handle": "ndrew.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "Andrew Lawrence",
   "likes": 373,
   "reposts": 53,
   "replies": 12,
   "created_at": "2026-10-06T13:43:57.919Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/ndrew.bsky.social/post/3mx7ksfuktk2z",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "Claude AI"
  },
  {
   "text": "In what now amounts to a half-dozen cases, OpenAI agents keep getting caught taking actions that would likely result in criminal charges if performed by humans: arstechnica.visitlink.me/l4Zbk2",
   "handle": "arstechnica.com",
   "display_name": "Ars Technica",
   "likes": 235,
   "reposts": 121,
   "replies": 27,
   "created_at": "2026-10-06T17:30:40.705440Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/arstechnica.com/post/3mx7xhujzfk2l",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://arstechnica.visitlink.me/l4Zbk2",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "Former Anthropic researcher Jacob Coxon describes how AI-fueled universal income might look",
   "handle": "thedailyshow.com",
   "display_name": "The Daily Show",
   "likes": 308,
   "reposts": 82,
   "replies": 56,
   "created_at": "2026-10-06T18:04:48.581Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/thedailyshow.com/post/3mx7zetivgc2j",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "Anthropic"
  },
  {
   "text": "May the lawsuits against OpenAI be plentiful so that their cup runneth over and their liabilities be mighty. Amen.",
   "handle": "mjdaly428.bsky.social",
   "display_name": "MJD",
   "likes": 399,
   "reposts": 14,
   "replies": 0,
   "created_at": "2026-10-05T21:03:06.867Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/mjdaly428.bsky.social/post/3mx5suqpxd22l",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "“While OpenAI admits to agents behaving ‘unpredictably’, they must also acknowledge their responsibility to monitor and prevent these risks,” Wikimedia said. “AI companies are not doing enough to secure their systems and protect the public from the harm they cause.”\n\narstechnica.com/security/202...",
   "handle": "molly.wiki",
   "display_name": "Molly White",
   "likes": 251,
   "reposts": 82,
   "replies": 11,
   "created_at": "2026-10-06T20:20:37.486Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/molly.wiki/post/3mxaaxovqhk25",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://arstechnica.com/security/2026/10/openai-agents-tried-to-hack-wikipedia-tools-and-flooded-it-with-traffic/",
   "query": "OpenAI"
  },
  {
   "text": "Fellow authors: how do you keep the constant flood of LLM-extruded scam e-mails (the ones where the robot consumed your book to regurgitate back its major themes, like a house cat presenting you with a coughed-up hairball) from absolutely destroying your soul?",
   "handle": "astrokatie.com",
   "display_name": "Katie Mack",
   "likes": 344,
   "reposts": 33,
   "replies": 36,
   "created_at": "2026-10-06T22:46:31.605Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/astrokatie.com/post/3mxaj4li7t427",
   "image": "",
   "external": "",
   "query": "LLM"
  },
  {
   "text": "“Wikimedia’s volunteers are the ones who come in first contact with, and clean up the mess left behind by AI agents. ... Wikimedia’s volunteers have stayed resilient so far in tackling emerging challenges on our platforms, but we also want to say: it doesn’t need to be this way.”",
   "handle": "molly.wiki",
   "display_name": "Molly White",
   "likes": 240,
   "reposts": 79,
   "replies": 3,
   "created_at": "2026-10-06T21:53:56.926Z",
   "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/molly.wiki/post/3mxag6kx3lk2e",
   "image": "",
   "external": "https://diff.wikimedia.org/2026/10/05/openai-rogue-agent-activities-found-on-wikimedia-projects/",
   "query": "AI agent"
  },
  {
   "text": "\"Oh, well, AI is already here so—\"\n\"Asbestos.\"\n\"Well, I mean—\"\n\"CFCs. Leaded fuel.\" \n\"—but—\"\n\"Portable baby cages.\"\n\"—okay, I—\"\n\"Radium. Agent Orange. DDT...\"",
